{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":835949,"username":"RedPriest","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forums.crateentertainment.com/redpriest/{size}/28937_2.png","created_at":"2025-06-24T13:33:37.735Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eI installed the game and created a new character. I thought characters were stored in C:\\Users\\username\\Documents\\My Games\\Grim Dawn\\save\\main\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eProblem is - I do not have a My Games folder. There is nothing in Documents at all (I purposely cleared it out to see when Grim Dawn creates that folder). My character loads every time, so question is - where is the game looking for the character file if it is not in the default location ?\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"updated_at":"2025-06-24T13:33:56.736Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1223,"reads":44,"readers_count":43,"score":5883.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":146160,"topic_slug":"where-is-my-character-saved-file","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":45466,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false},{"id":835951,"username":"Gnomish_Inquisition","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forums.crateentertainment.com/gnomish_inquisition/{size}/39289_2.png","created_at":"2025-06-24T13:38:21.410Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eif you have cloud saves enabled \u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eingame\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/em\u003e the game saves to your steam folder on steam version C:\\Program Files (x86)\\Steam\\userdata\\ “folder of numbers”\\219990\\remote\u003cbr\u003e\n^start path might be different if you have a custom steam install\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eif you have cloud off it then should save to My games, but if there is no folder at all in my games it’s usually a hint that Onedrive has hijacked the folder and it’s somewhere in the onedrive subpath\u003cbr\u003e\n*that’s assuming you’re not on linux where it’s probably an entirely different basket court\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":2,"post_type":1,"updated_at":"2025-06-24T13:40:32.803Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":42,"readers_count":41,"score":13.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":146160,"topic_slug":"where-is-my-character-saved-file","primary_group_name":"Registered_Users","flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":11392,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false},{"id":835953,"username":"RedPriest","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forums.crateentertainment.com/redpriest/{size}/28937_2.png","created_at":"2025-06-24T13:44:16.753Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHi - thanks for the reply. I am running the GOG version, on Windows, so no Steam and no cloud saves.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI do not have One drive active - at least I’m not signed in to it and in the One drive folder there is no Documents\\My Games folder that I can see. It’s still possible that one drive has stolen it but where would I find the folder to confirm that ?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI better go turn off the One drive service altogether. Maybe that will give me back local saves under Documents.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":3,"post_type":1,"updated_at":"2025-06-24T13:44:16.753Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":2,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":5,"reads":43,"readers_count":42,"score":38.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":146160,"topic_slug":"where-is-my-character-saved-file","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"reply_to_user":{"username":"Gnomish_Inquisition","name":"Gnomish Inquisition","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forums.crateentertainment.com/gnomish_inquisition/{size}/39289_2.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":45466,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false},{"id":835959,"username":"medea_fleecestealer","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forums.crateentertainment.com/medea_fleecestealer/{size}/110_2.png","created_at":"2025-06-24T13:50:44.416Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eIf you are using GOG Galaxy then yes, you are using cloud saving and that is where your saves will be going.  You would need to turn that off to use local saves.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.crateentertainment.com/uploads/default/original/3X/4/e/4ef09ffb160ce9415f7dcf40bbceabefd3a7e241.png\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.crateentertainment.com/uploads/default/4ef09ffb160ce9415f7dcf40bbceabefd3a7e241\" title=\"image\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://forums.crateentertainment.com/uploads/default/original/3X/4/e/4ef09ffb160ce9415f7dcf40bbceabefd3a7e241.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"bgkMjjLvi0qh9MHGfvWg1nv4jnP\" width=\"690\" height=\"437\" data-dominant-color=\"363336\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c