 has been reports that it was necessary to disable it/onedrive in registry/via registry edit before it would act nice\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":8,"post_type":1,"updated_at":"2025-06-24T13:59:59.858Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":7,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":28,"readers_count":27,"score":10.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":146160,"topic_slug":"where-is-my-character-saved-file","primary_group_name":"Registered_Users","flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","reply_to_user":{"username":"RedPriest","name":null,"avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forums.crateentertainment.com/redpriest/{size}/28937_2.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":11392,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false},{"id":835991,"username":"RedPriest","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forums.crateentertainment.com/redpriest/{size}/28937_2.png","created_at":"2025-06-24T19:32:14.078Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eI uninstalled it from the add/remove programs list. It is impressive if somehow it is still on. You’re correct - it is still somehow saving to the one drive folder. I’ll delete that folder and see if that clear it up, otherwise it’s off to hunt a registry key I guess, which seems nuts since it is now uninstalled. Can’t get much more dead then that \u003cimg src=\"https://forums.crateentertainment.com/images/emoji/twitter/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":9,"post_type":1,"updated_at":"2025-06-24T19:32:14.078Z","reply_count":2,"reply_to_post_number":8,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":26,"readers_count":25,"score":15.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":146160,"topic_slug":"where-is-my-character-saved-file","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"reply_to_user":{"username":"Gnomish_Inquisition","name":"Gnomish Inquisition","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forums.crateentertainment.com/gnomish_inquisition/{size}/39289_2.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":45466,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false},{"id":835992,"username":"Gnomish_Inquisition","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forums.crateentertainment.com/gnomish_inquisition/{size}/39289_2.png","created_at":"2025-06-24T19:52:51.289Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003ethis was the comment i saved on it\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cblockquote\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHKEY_CURRENT_USER\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Explorer\\User Shell Folders\u003cbr\u003e\nDelete \"OneDrive\" under “Personal”\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ebut iirc it was said later MS “fixed” that fix so it may not work any longer \u003cimg src=\"https://forums.crateentertainment.com/images/emoji/twitter/sweat_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":sweat_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":sweat_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":10,"post_type":1,"updated_at":"2025-06-24T19:52:51.289Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":9,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":26,"readers_count":25,"score":10.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":146160,"topic_slug":"where-is-my-character-saved-file","primary_group_name":"Registered_Users","flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":